Implemented auto-retry capability for transient failures. Added RetryManager with pattern matching for network timeouts, rate limits, API errors, lock conflicts, and missing dependencies. Integrated with escalation system (Level 0 before alerts). Tracks retry history on tasks (retryCount, lastRetryReason, retryHistory). Prevents infinite loops with max retry limits (3 default, 2 for context issues) and same-root-cause detection. All retry logic tested and verified.